## Code review findings (all fixed)

- **[C] pricing.rs:** PricingTable re-loaded on every call. Fixed with OnceLock cache.
- **[H] scan_cmd.rs:** Always returned exit code 0. Fixed to return 1 on blocking findings.
- **[H] pr_linker.rs:** Misleading "<1ms" doc comment (spawns git subprocess). Updated doc.
- **[H] dep_validator.rs:** Regex compiled on every parse call. Fixed with lazy_regex macro.
- **[M] license_checker.rs:** Repurposing HallucinatedDep for license issues. Added LicenseViolation variant.
- **[M] quality_gate.rs:** Naive glob matching in should_ignore. Fixed with path-segment-boundary matching.
- **[M] cost_store.rs:** i64→u64 cast without .max(0). Fixed.

## Parallel implementation approach

Both phases implemented via `Agent(isolation: "worktree")`. Since the target repo (rtk-analysis) differs from the orchestration repo (master_investments_mmo), both agents wrote directly to rtk-analysis. Merged cleanly — shared files (main.rs, core/mod.rs) had no conflicts because the second agent extended what the first wrote.

